"""
Juliet's Sweet Treats — Bakery Order Calculator

Features:
- Multiple items per order
- Add quantities
- Update an existing item
- Remove an item or reduce its quantity
- Cash payment
- Bank Transfer simulation
- Card payment simulation
- Receipt displayed on screen
- Receipt saved as a .txt file

Run with:

    python3 bakery_calculator.py

NOTE:
The bank transfer flow is only a simulation. It does not connect to
a real bank and cannot verify that money was actually transferred.
"""

